 "<h2>🗺️ День</h2>{0}\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Все игры</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {1}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Простой день</b><small>тропа и двери дня; если выключить — у ребёнка снова все вкладки</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Обязательно каждый день</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Обязательное идёт по тропе по порядку. Остальное — «по желанию», после сундука.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{2}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Двери дня</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdK\">{3}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Сегодня: {4}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{5}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Выключенная тема не приходит в двери. Открыть дверь сегодня:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— выбрать —</option>{6}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Любимая игра</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{7}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">сама: {8}</option>{9}</select>": [
  "<h2>🗺️ Day</h2>{0}\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 All games</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {1}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Simple day</b><small>path and doors of the day; if you turn it off, the child gets all the tabs again</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Must do every day</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">The must-dos come along the path in order. The rest is \"if you like\", after the chest.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{2}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Doors of the day</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdK\">{3}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Today: {4}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{5}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">A topic that is turned off does not come to the doors. Open a door today:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— choose —</option>{6}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Favourite game</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{7}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">by itself: {8}</option>{9}</select>",
  "<h2>🗺️ Dia</h2>{0}\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Todos os jogos</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {1}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Dia simples</b><small>trilho e portas do dia; se desligares, a criança volta a ter todos os separadores</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Obrigatório todos os dias</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">O obrigatório vem pelo trilho, por ordem. O resto é «se quiseres», depois do baú.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{2}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Portas do dia</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdK\">{3}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Hoje: {4}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{5}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Um tema desligado não aparece nas portas. Abrir uma porta hoje:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— escolher —</option>{6}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Jogo preferido</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{7}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">automático: {8}</option>{9}</select>",
  "<h2>🗺️ Tag</h2>{0}\n      <button class=\"big\" id=\"sdAll\">🎮 Alle Spiele</button>\n      <label class=\"sw\" for=\"sdOn\"><input id=\"sdOn\" type=\"checkbox\" {1}><span class=\"set-t\"><b>Einfacher Tag</b><small>Pfad und Türen des Tages; wenn du es ausschaltest, hat das Kind wieder alle Tabs</small></span></label>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Jeden Tag Pflicht</h3>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Die Pflichtsachen kommen der Reihe nach auf dem Pfad. Der Rest ist „wenn du magst“, nach der Truhe.</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-must\">{2}</div>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Türen des Tages</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdK\">{3}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Heute: {4}</p>\n      <div class=\"sd-areas\" id=\"sdAreas\">{5}</div>\n      <p class=\"sd-note\">Ein ausgeschaltetes Thema kommt nicht in die Türen. Tür für heute öffnen:</p>\n      <select id=\"sdAdd\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">— auswählen —</option>{6}</select>\n      <h3 class=\"fam-s\">Lieblingsspiel</h3>\n      <div class=\"sd-seg\" id=\"sdFavM\">{7}</div>\n      <select id=\"sdFavG\" class=\"sd-sel\"><option value=\"\">selbst: {8}</option>{9}</select>"
 ],
 "<div class=\"winbox\" role=\"dialog\"><div class=\"ryz-w lt-hop\">{0}</div>\n      <h2>Давай только одну!</h2><p class=\"win-line\">{1}: одна маленькая игра — и шаг готов.</p>\n      <div class=\"win-btns\"><button class=\"big\" data-a=\"one\">Одну!</button><button class=\"big ghost\" data-a=\"later\">Потом</button></div></div>": [
  "<div class=\"winbox\" role=\"dialog\"><div class=\"ryz-w lt-hop\">{0}</div>\n      <h2>Let's do just one!</h2><p class=\"win-line\">{1}: one little game and the step is done.</p>\n      <div class=\"win-btns\"><button class=\"big\" data-a=\"one\">Just one!</button><button class=\"big ghost\" data-a=\"later\">Later</button></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"winbox\" role=\"dialog\"><div class=\"ryz-w lt-hop\">{0}</div>\n      <h2>Vamos fazer só uma!</h2><p class=\"win-line\">{1}: um joguinho e o passo está feito.</p>\n      <div class=\"win-btns\"><button class=\"big\" data-a=\"one\">Só uma!</button><button class=\"big ghost\" data-a=\"later\">Depois</button></div></div>",
  "<div class=\"winbox\" role=\"dialog\"><div class=\"ryz-w lt-hop\">{0}</div>\n      <h2>Machen wir nur eins!</h2><p class=\"win-line\">{1}: ein kleines Spiel und der Schritt ist fertig.</p>\n      <div class=\"win-btns\"><button class=\"big\" data-a=\"one\">Nur eins!</button><button class=\"big ghost\" data-a=\"later\">Später</button></div></div>"
 ],
